           <p class="post-date">
            <span class="month">Dec</span>
            <span class="day">20</span>
           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/category/mvc/" title="View all posts in MVC" rel="category tag">MVC</a> | <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2007/12/asp-net-mvc-checkbox-boolean-value-mapping/#comments" class="comments"  title="Comment on ASP.Net MVC Checkbox/boolean Value Mapping"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="702 /blogs/ryanc/archive/2007/12/20/asp-net-mvc-checkbox-boolean-value-mapping.aspx">1 Comment</span></a>              </span>
           </p>
          </div>

          <div class="post-content clearfix">
