          <div class="post-header">
           <h3 class="post-title"><a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2007/12/asp-net-mvc-and-forms-authentication/" rel="bookmark" title="Permanent Link: ASP.Net MVC and Forms Authentication">ASP.Net MVC and Forms Authentication</a></h3>
           <p class="post-date">
            <span class="month">Dec</span>
