           </p>
           <p class="post-author">
            <span class="info">Posted by <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/author/cromwellryan/" title="Posts by cromwellryan ">cromwellryan</a> in <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/category/net/" title="View all posts in .Net" rel="category tag">.Net</a>, <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/category/mvc/" title="View all posts in MVC" rel="category tag">MVC</a> | <a href="http://cromwellhaus.com/2007/12/asp-net-mvc-and-forms-authentication/#comments" class="comments"  title="Comment on ASP.Net MVC and Forms Authentication"><span class="dsq-postid" rel="701 /blogs/ryanc/archive/2007/12/19/asp-net-mvc-and-forms-authentication.aspx">11 Comments</span></a>              </span>
